{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124213","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124213/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124213/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124213/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124213","id":5724681208,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVTez-A","number":124213,"title":"Incorrect reference_luminance in HDR texture rendering","user":{"login":"woruteyqi","id":20475872,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDc1ODcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20475872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi","html_url":"https://github.com/woruteyqi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woruteyqi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-06T07:28:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T15:50:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T20:24:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThe issue can be reproduced in all versions after 4.7. I couldn't find any changes related to the \"hdr\" keyword in the changelog for version 4.8, so the problem persists.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26300) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1714) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12650H (16 threads) - 31.72 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Surround 7.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter importing the HDR image into Godot, you may notice that it appears unusually bright in the editor preview. In fact, when placed on a TextureRect and run at runtime, the image looks exactly as it does in the editor preview.\n\nBased on my testing, setting hdr_output_current_reference_luminance to half of its original value resolves the rendering issue for HDR textures. However, this adjustment negatively affects the reference luminance for other SDR content.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project.\n2. Enable \"Request HDR Output\" and \"HDR 2D\" in the Project Settings.\n3. Import an HDR image (in EXR format or any other supported format).\n4. Check the imported result.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[hdr_texure_issue_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33092427/hdr_texure_issue_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}